# Day 50

**0km / 0 hours**

*Whakahoro*

Another day held up by the rain and the river... 

I don't have much to say about these dull days since not much is going on. Perhaps the most interesting thing is the number of people who are now catching up to us since we're stuck. Many of them started much later than me but have hitched or skipped sections. I bear no ill will to them for that but it's not the kind of thing I would prefer to do. My social awkwardness also feels particularly sharp when there's many people around that I don't know, perhaps that's good for me to grow accustomed to. 

I don't know.